---
/*
  ** 이 파일이 `---`로 시작하는 이유 **
  `<svg` 또는 주석으로 시작하는 `.astro`는 PC로 보낼 때 콘텐츠 서명(C2PA)이 붙어
  **정확히 +7,774바이트가 끼어들고 파일이 깨진다.** 그러면 Astro가
  "Expected `>` but found `:`" 로 빌드를 멈춘다.
  프런트매터가 맨 앞에 있으면 붙지 않는다. 규약 §5 제작 표준에 적힌 조항이고,
  이 파일은 그것을 지키지 않아 실제로 전송 중 깨졌다(2026-09-20).

  2/3의 출처: 참가자가 항상 문1을 고른다고 두고, 자동차가 1·2·3에 있는
  세 경우를 한 블록씩 세로로. 각 블록 안에 문 3개, 그 아래 switch/stay 승패를
  색과 글자·모양(체크/엑스)으로 같이 표시. 세로형(viewBox 420폭 이하).
  문 안의 염소·차는 직접 그린 실루엣 SVG(symbol+use 재사용, 문 9개=goat 6+car 3).
*/
---
<svg
  class="fig-svg"
  viewBox="0 0 420 710"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Three stacked cases showing where the car could be, given the player always picks door 1. Case 1: the car (drawn as a car silhouette) is behind door 1, the host opens door 2 to reveal a goat silhouette, door 3 stays closed with a goat behind it; switching loses and staying wins. Case 2: the car is behind door 2, the host opens door 3 to reveal a goat, door 1 — the player's pick — has a goat behind it; switching wins and staying loses. Case 3: the car is behind door 3, the host opens door 2 to reveal a goat, door 1 has a goat behind it; switching wins and staying loses. Overall, switching wins two of the three cases and staying wins one."
>
  <defs>
    <symbol id="fig-goat" viewBox="0 0 84 100">
      <path d="M18,44 Q16,40 22,40 L46,40 Q54,40 56,46 L56,58 Q56,64 48,64 L22,64 Q16,64 16,56 Z" />
      <path d="M48,46 L48,32 Q48,26 56,24 L64,24 Q70,24 72,30 L74,36 Q75,40 71,41 L62,41 Q56,41 54,46 Z" />
      <path d="M54,26 Q44,14 32,4 Q46,4 58,12 Q66,18 64,25 Z" />
      <path d="M62,22 L74,17 L67,28 Z" />
      <path d="M68,40 L75,40 L71,54 Z" />
      <rect x="21" y="63" width="6" height="26" rx="2" />
      <rect x="31" y="63" width="6" height="26" rx="2" />
      <rect x="42" y="63" width="6" height="26" rx="2" />
      <rect x="50" y="63" width="6" height="26" rx="2" />
      <path d="M16,42 L11,29 L20,37 Z" />
      <circle cx="64" cy="32" r="2.6" fill="var(--paper)" />
    </symbol>
    <symbol id="fig-car" viewBox="0 0 160 70">
      <path d="M10,50 L10,40 Q12,34 20,32 Q26,20 40,16 Q52,8 66,8 Q78,8 84,14 Q100,16 112,24 Q126,28 138,34 Q148,36 148,42 L148,50 Z" />
      <circle cx="40" cy="52" r="10" />
      <circle cx="120" cy="52" r="10" />
      <circle cx="40" cy="52" r="4" fill="var(--paper)" />
      <circle cx="120" cy="52" r="4" fill="var(--paper)" />
    </symbol>
  </defs>

  <line x1="10" y1="225" x2="410" y2="225" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1" />
  <line x1="10" y1="455" x2="410" y2="455" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1" />

  <!-- Case 1 — car behind door 1: stay wins, switch loses -->
  <text x="210" y="30" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)" text-anchor="middle">Case 1 · car @ door 1</text>

  <text x="152" y="48" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">you</text>
  <rect x="134" y="54" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="3" />
  <use href="#fig-car" x="137" y="88" width="30" height="13" fill="var(--graphite)" />

  <text x="210" y="48" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">open</text>
  <rect x="192" y="54" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--paper-sunk)" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
  <use href="#fig-goat" x="194.4" y="76" width="31.1" height="37" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" />

  <text x="268" y="48" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">switch→</text>
  <rect x="250" y="54" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2" />
  <use href="#fig-goat" x="252.4" y="76" width="31.1" height="37" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" />

  <circle cx="100" cy="155" r="11" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--series-1)" stroke-width="2" />
  <path d="M93,148 L107,162 M93,162 L107,148" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
  <text x="118" y="160" class="fig-label" fill="var(--series-1)">switch</text>
  <text x="185" y="160" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)">lose</text>

  <circle cx="100" cy="183" r="11" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--series-2)" stroke-width="2" />
  <path d="M93,183 L98,189 L109,175" fill="none" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
  <text x="118" y="188" class="fig-label" fill="var(--series-2)">stay</text>
  <text x="175" y="188" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)">win</text>

  <!-- Case 2 — car behind door 2: switch wins, stay loses -->
  <text x="210" y="260" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)" text-anchor="middle">Case 2 · car @ door 2</text>

  <text x="152" y="278" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">you</text>
  <rect x="134" y="284" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="3" />
  <use href="#fig-goat" x="136.4" y="306" width="31.1" height="37" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" />

  <text x="210" y="278" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">switch→</text>
  <rect x="192" y="284" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2" />
  <use href="#fig-car" x="195" y="318" width="30" height="13" fill="var(--graphite)" />

  <text x="268" y="278" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">open</text>
  <rect x="250" y="284" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--paper-sunk)" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
  <use href="#fig-goat" x="252.4" y="306" width="31.1" height="37" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" />

  <circle cx="100" cy="385" r="11" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--series-1)" stroke-width="2" />
  <path d="M93,385 L98,391 L109,377" fill="none" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
  <text x="118" y="390" class="fig-label" fill="var(--series-1)">switch</text>
  <text x="185" y="390" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)">win</text>

  <circle cx="100" cy="413" r="11" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--series-2)" stroke-width="2" />
  <path d="M93,406 L107,420 M93,420 L107,406" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
  <text x="118" y="418" class="fig-label" fill="var(--series-2)">stay</text>
  <text x="175" y="418" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)">lose</text>

  <!-- Case 3 — car behind door 3: switch wins, stay loses -->
  <text x="210" y="490" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)" text-anchor="middle">Case 3 · car @ door 3</text>

  <text x="152" y="508" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">you</text>
  <rect x="134" y="514" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="3" />
  <use href="#fig-goat" x="136.4" y="536" width="31.1" height="37" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" />

  <text x="210" y="508" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">open</text>
  <rect x="192" y="514" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--paper-sunk)" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
  <use href="#fig-goat" x="194.4" y="536" width="31.1" height="37" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" />

  <text x="268" y="508" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite-soft)" text-anchor="middle">switch→</text>
  <rect x="250" y="514" width="36" height="80" rx="2" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2" />
  <use href="#fig-car" x="253" y="548" width="30" height="13" fill="var(--graphite)" />

  <circle cx="100" cy="615" r="11" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--series-1)" stroke-width="2" />
  <path d="M93,615 L98,621 L109,607" fill="none" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
  <text x="118" y="620" class="fig-label" fill="var(--series-1)">switch</text>
  <text x="185" y="620" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)">win</text>

  <circle cx="100" cy="643" r="11" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--series-2)" stroke-width="2" />
  <path d="M93,636 L107,650 M93,650 L107,636" stroke="var(--graphite)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
  <text x="118" y="648" class="fig-label" fill="var(--series-2)">stay</text>
  <text x="175" y="648" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)">lose</text>

  <text x="210" y="685" class="fig-label" fill="var(--graphite)" text-anchor="middle">switch wins 2 of 3 · stay wins 1 of 3</text>
</svg>
